{"hits": {"hits": [{"created": "2026-07-24T08:41:27.322824+00:00", "modified": "2026-07-24T08:41:27.972903+00:00", "id": 21529081, "conceptrecid": "21488115", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.21529081", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.21488115", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21529081", "metadata": {"title": "QIK-VRT: Quellengebundene Lean-4-Formalisierung des 62-seitigen Manuskripts \u2013 Alpha 3 mit vollst\u00e4ndiger Formalumgebungsabdeckung", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.21529081", "publication_date": "2026-07-24", "description": "<p>Reproduzierbarer Alpha-3-Stand der quellengebundenen Lean-4-Formalisierung des gesperrten 62-seitigen QIK-VRT-Manuskripts. Alle 20 Definitionsumgebungen und alle 20 theorem-artigen Umgebungen besitzen einen geschlossenen maschinenlesbaren Status; 42 starke quellengebundene Bindungen sind materialisiert und kein formaler Knoten bleibt offen.</p><p>Sechs Aussagen bleiben ausdr\u00fccklich bedingt, wobei jede zus\u00e4tzliche Annahme im Lean-Typ sichtbar ist. Empirische, interpretative, metaphysische, spirituelle, retrokausale und quantengravitative Aussagen werden nicht zu mathematischen Theoremen hochgestuft.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Lohmann, Ingolf", "affiliation": "Independent researcher; QIK-VRT"}], "keywords": ["QIK-VRT", "Lean 4", "formal verification", "machine-verifiable science", "claim graph", "source provenance", "proof objects", "axiom audit", "conditional proof", "reproducible research"], "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "10.5281/zenodo.21518464", "relation": "isNewVersionOf", "resource_type": "software", "scheme": "doi"}, {"identifier": "10.5281/zenodo.21482023", "relation": "isSupplementTo", "resource_type": "publication-workingpaper", "scheme": "doi"}], "version": "2.0.0-alpha.3", "language": "deu", "resource_type": {"title": "Software", "type": "software"}, "license": {"id": "other-nc"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 4, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "21488115"}}]}, "notes": "Formal-environment completion with explicit epistemic boundaries. Authority commit 3d640b05e815ff8644fe7640ddd7dcf89d4094c4; Git tree 6056f024cc0376f6820eca948205c30ac75d7d41; repository content-tree SHA-256 964801915be7eb1f33bfad52326c33bf47582fa77bd44dd572a46fc21ad79dcb; deterministic archive SHA-256 f62ef815cc578735c97f3cc94ca4d156a11a6c130231f94d40d0bfe2e2b7f6ab; public Alpha-2 source-evidence SHA-256 f3e3903830abaf945ca296bcbf87277cd8cc1d9aa29053927a177a441659599b. Zenodo persistence establishes identity and byte fixity, not peer review or empirical confirmation."}, "title": "QIK-VRT: Quellengebundene Lean-4-Formalisierung des 62-seitigen Manuskripts \u2013 Alpha 3 mit vollst\u00e4ndiger Formalumgebungsabdeckung", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21529081", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/21529081", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/21529081?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21529081", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21529081", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.21529081", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21529081/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21488115", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/21488115", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21488115", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.21488115", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:21529081/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:21529081/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21529081/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21529081/media-files", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21529081/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/21529081/latest", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21529081/versions", "draft": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21529081/draft", "access_links": "https://zenodo.org/api/records